# =====================================
# 仅保留核心代码（白名单模式）
# =====================================

# 1) 默认忽略仓库根目录下所有内容
/*

# 2) 仅放行核心代码与必要配置
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!index.html
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!README.md

!config/
!config/**

!core/
!core/**

!tools/
!tools/**

!public/
!public/**

!tests/
!tests/**

!src-tauri/
!src-tauri/**

# 3) 在已放行目录中，继续忽略构建产物与本地文件
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/
src-tauri/MediaInfo.dll
src-tauri/bin/
*.dll
*.dylib
*.so

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

*.log
*.tmp
.tmp/
tmp/

.claude/
.claudecode
.codexignore
/core/assets/*
!/core/assets/styles/

# 4) Markdown 仅保留 README 与 About 页
*.md
!README.md
!public/about.md
